/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/str.k-18-
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/str.k-19-  // ==== operators: + / == / != / in =========================================
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/str.k-20-  syntax IntSeq ::= seqConcat(IntSeq, IntSeq) [function, total]
