+| 1 | lines 8–15 | `b71ea096f6e92dea97adefa58c521bb4aab0f25d49e84fa784b5a0cb3ceee82d` / `rule-b71ea096f6e92dea97adefa58c521bb4aab0f25d49e84fa784b5a0cb3ceee82d` | none | `DEFINITION` |
